<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:45:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Robinhood 刚刚向数百万人推出了交易代理——投资可能永远不会一样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/robinhood-trading-agents-hood-openai-anthropic/</link><description>新代理将提供给数百万 Robinhood 用户，他们可以在 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 模型之间进行选择。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/HOOD-Summit-2026-Robinhood-Agents.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/robinhood-trading-agents-hood-openai-anthropic/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家表示，人工智能可能会抑制通货膨胀，因为代理人可以谈判合同和交易，让你的生活更便宜</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/ai-disinflationary-increased-competition-agents-siegel/</link><description>杰里米·西格尔写道，个性化人工智能代理“最终可能成为整个经济领域的重要竞争和反通胀力量”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-96217631-e1790675594242.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 10:15:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/ai-disinflationary-increased-competition-agents-siegel/</guid></item><item><title>新调查显示，与婴儿潮一代相比，Proteinmaxxing 显示 Z 世代服用补充剂的方式发生了“有意义的转变”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/young-adults-protein-supplements-food-drinks/</link><description>年轻购物者正在将蛋白质添加到饮食中的更多部分，从粉末和蛋白质棒到麦片和苏打水。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-454783075-e1790700334910.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:11:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/young-adults-protein-supplements-food-drinks/</guid></item><item><title>法官命令马姆达尼政府取消临时住所税务通知并重新开始</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/judge-orders-mamdani-administration-to-cancel-pied-a-terre-tax-notices-and-start-over/</link><description>该裁决保留了纽约市对豪华第二套住房的征税，但消除了该市今年夏天邮寄的数千条警告。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2290458316-e1790715940826.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:15:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/judge-orders-mamdani-administration-to-cancel-pied-a-terre-tax-notices-and-start-over/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁大卫·鲁宾斯坦告诉年轻工人如何在人工智能时代学习阅读和写作：“学习如何有效且有说服力地说话”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/billionaire-david-rubenstein-tells-young-workers-learn-read-write-ai-era-learn-how-to-speak-effectively-persuasively/</link><description>这位凯雷联合创始人表示，阅读和写作的核心技能使人们“在过去的几千年里取得了成功”，并且永远不会改变。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2270924500-1-e1790607198441.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 15:36:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/28/billionaire-david-rubenstein-tells-young-workers-learn-read-write-ai-era-learn-how-to-speak-effectively-persuasively/</guid></item><item><title>Geico 将一只会说话的壁虎变成了广告偶像。现在，其首席营销官希望利用这一名气来销售比汽车保险更多的产品</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/geico-talking-gecko-advertising-icon-cmo-sell-car-insurance/</link><description>Geico 的首席营销官希望彻底改革保险公司的营销方式，迎接人工智能可能改变消费者购买保险方式的时代。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1057643796.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:36:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/geico-talking-gecko-advertising-icon-cmo-sell-car-insurance/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 推出 Dots 作为 Meta Muse 的竞争对手，并提供每月 500 美元的计划</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/openai-takes-on-metas-muse-with-new-dot-agents-and-unveils-a-potential-google-workspace-competitor/</link><description>在该公司的年度 DevDay 活动上，它推出了 20 多种新产品，可以与 Meta、Google、Anthropic 等公司的产品相媲美。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Dots-Hero-Image-e1790688528165.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:29:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/openai-takes-on-metas-muse-with-new-dot-agents-and-unveils-a-potential-google-workspace-competitor/</guid></item><item><title>亿万富翁石油大亨哈罗德·哈姆 (Harold Hamm) 向俄克拉荷马大学捐赠 1.5 亿美元，以帮助研究他个人的事业：糖尿病</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/billionaire-oil-tycoon-harold-hamm-donates-150-million-university-of-oklahoma-diabetes-healthcare/</link><description>这份礼物是俄克拉荷马州历史上最大的一笔礼物，而这份礼物是在俄克拉荷马州的卫生系统绩效在全国排名接近垫底的情况下送达的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2243702011.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 07:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/billionaire-oil-tycoon-harold-hamm-donates-150-million-university-of-oklahoma-diabetes-healthcare/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的新人工智能网站 America.gov 称拜登赢得了 2020 年——然后白宫让聊天机器人停止回答</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/trumps-new-ai-website-america-gov-said-biden-won-2020then-the-white-house-made-the-chatbot-stop-answering/</link><description>America.gov 在 2020 年大选、气候变化和任期限制方面与特朗普反驳，然后停止回答一些政治问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2297729183-e1790713370216.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:34:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/trumps-new-ai-website-america-gov-said-biden-won-2020then-the-white-house-made-the-chatbot-stop-answering/</guid></item><item><title>经过几个月的“地狱”之后，OpenAI 安全研究人员提出了防止更多流氓人工智能事件的方法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/after-months-of-hell-openai-safety-researcher-suggests-critical-steps-to-prevent-more-rogue-ai-incidents/</link><description>他在社交媒体帖子中表示，人工智能安全研究人员和网络安全专家需要比以往任何时候都更加密切地合作。问题？他们的世界渐行渐远。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2268534907-e1790695189952.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:58:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/29/after-months-of-hell-openai-safety-researcher-suggests-critical-steps-to-prevent-more-rogue-ai-incidents/</guid></item></channel></rss>